# Onboarding Checklist

## Day 1: Environment Setup

### ✅ Prerequisites
- [ ] Python 3.12+ installed
- [ ] Git installed and configured
- [ ] VS Code or preferred IDE installed
- [ ] PostgreSQL installed locally

### ✅ Repository Setup
- [ ] Clone the repository
- [ ] Create and activate virtual environment
- [ ] Install dependencies: `pip install -r requirements.txt`
- [ ] Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and configure

### ✅ Verify Setup
- [ ] Run tests: `pytest`
- [ ] Start development server: `uvicorn src.main:app --reload`
- [ ] Access API docs at `http://localhost:8000/docs`

## Day 2: Git Workflow
- [ ] Read [Branching Strategy](../git_workflow/branching_strategy.md)
- [ ] Create first feature branch
- [ ] Review [Commit Guidelines](../git_workflow/commit_guidelines.md)

## Day 3: First Contribution
- [ ] Pick a `good first issue`
- [ ] Create PR following [PR Guide](../git_workflow/pull_request_guide.md)
- [ ] Get your first PR merged! 🎉

## Need Help?
- Check [Troubleshooting](../quick_reference/troubleshooting.md)
